# Rendered swarm-stack files emitted by ConvertTo-FilteredStack (PID-suffixed
# temp files written next to vibemind-stack.yml so relative env_file paths
# resolve identically). Cleanup is best-effort in scripts/lib/vibemind-helpers.ps1
# but crashes / Ctrl+C can leave one behind.
infra/swarm/.vibemind-stack-rendered-*.yml

